Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:06.52,Sub,I was born in 1998, in\NLeka Dulecha, East
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.52,0:00:07.70,Sub,Wollega.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.50,0:00:13.52,Sub,My father, Bulti Firissa,\Nis a teacher of geography
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.52,0:00:14.70,Sub,and history.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.50,0:00:20.29,Sub,From him, I learned where\Nwe come from, and how the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.29,0:00:21.70,Sub,world connects.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:34.24,Sub,I went to Addis Ababa to\Nstudy software
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.24,0:00:35.70,Sub,engineering.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.50,0:00:42.70,Sub,My father mapped the land.\NI learned to map systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.50,0:00:48.12,Sub,Today I build banking\Nsystems at Cooperative
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.12,0:00:49.70,Sub,Bank of Oromia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.50,0:00:55.83,Sub,So that families like mine\Ncan send money home in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.83,0:00:56.70,Sub,seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.50,0:01:10.33,Sub,My father taught the\Nhistory of our land. I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.33,0:01:13.70,Sub,hope to help write its\Nfuture.
